				"description": "Winst-en-verliesrekening per art. 2:377 BW (REQ-T9-003). Model A 'categorisch' groups costs by type; Model E 'functioneel' groups costs by function. Model choice must be consistent year-on-year; a change is a stelselwijziging disclosure. Subtotals (bedrijfsresultaat, resultaat voor belasting, nettoresultaat) are computed. The model rubriek catalogue is configuration (lib/Settings/seeds/vw-model-rubrieken.json), not code.",
				"x-schema-org": "schema:MonetaryAmount",
				"x-spec": "openspec/changes/bookkeeping-titel-9-jaarrekening/specs/bookkeeping-titel-9-jaarrekening/spec.md",
				"type": "object",
				"required": [
